# The BMC's web interface, so a browser or a Bonjour browser finds the board
# without anyone knowing its address. HTTPS on 443, not the port-80 redirect:
# advertising the redirect makes a client take two round trips to reach a page
# that was always going to be served over TLS.
#
# The certificate is self-signed until SQU-115, so this points at a page the
# browser will warn about. That is the same warning it gives for the address,
# and hiding the board does not make the certificate better.
type _https._tcp
port 443
